*.js
!jest.config.js
*.d.ts
node_modules
cdk.out
.cdk.staging

# cdk.context.json is deliberately NOT ignored — it pins the exact VPC/
# subnet IDs resolved by Vpc.fromLookup(), so every future deploy uses
# the identical values instead of re-resolving (and potentially
# drifting) each time. Committing it is what makes "the same stack in
# the future" actually true.
